---
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="About Calcvera" description="Who runs Calcvera, why it exists and how we keep our finance calculators accurate.">
  <p>
    {SITE.name} is a set of free finance calculators for people in the United States and the United Kingdom, with more
    countries to follow. The name comes from "calc" and "vera", Latin for true: the point of the site is calculators
    you can trust.
  </p>

  <h2>Why this site exists</h2>
  <p>
    Many calculators online are built for one country and quietly used everywhere else, or give a number without
    saying how they got it. {SITE.name} builds a separate version for each country, uses that country's rules and
    currency, and shows the formula behind every result.
  </p>

  <h2>Who runs it</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} is built and maintained by {SITE.owner}. Every calculator is tested against known correct answers
    before it is published, and every tax figure is checked against the official government source.
  </p>

  <h2>What we don't do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We don't give financial advice. Our tools and guides are educational.</li>
    <li>We don't collect the numbers you type. Calculations run in your browser.</li>
    <li>We don't accept payment to change a calculator's results.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How the site is funded</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} is free to use and is supported by advertising. If we ever include affiliate links, they will be
    clearly labelled on the page and listed in our <a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a>.
  </p>

  <p>
    Read <a href="/methodology/">how we build our calculators</a>, or <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a> if you spot
    a mistake.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
